-symbol-free-png.webp","author":"Kayser Ali","bio":"","product":""}},"testimonial_4nXcQ7":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","heading":"Testimonials","text":"<p>I bought a watch from Mona Watch and I’m really satisfied with it. The quality is excellent, the prices are fair, and the people there are genuinely professional and trustworthy. I highly recommend them to anyone looking for a good watch at a reasonable price!<\/p>","avatar":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/google-icon-logo-symbol-free-png.webp","author":"Emre Elibol","bio":"","product":""}},"testimonial_dPMfPd":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Testimonials","text":"<p>I would like to thank Mona watches for there professional and honest deals. It's my second purchase from them and definitely will recommend them<\/p>","avatar":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/google-icon-logo-symbol-free-png.webp","author":"Ahmed Ezzat (MaSa)","bio":"","product":""}},"testimonial_CXAGMb":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Testimonials","text":"<p>The experience was exceptional. The sellers were both kind and demonstrated extensive knowledge of the watches. Pricing was also reasonable.<\/p>","avatar":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/google-icon-logo-symbol-free-png.webp","author":"Ismail Al Mashhoor","bio":"","product":""}},"testimonial_V9EYhr":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Testimonials","text":"<p>Great guys sitting opposite the counter , you will find great deals over here. Would say a must recommend to this place if you are in dubai and looking for deals on some great watches.<\/p>","avatar":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/google-icon-logo-symbol-free-png.webp","author":"Ashu Gupta","bio":"","product":""}},"testimonial_9AetwN":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Testimonials","text":"<p>Great experience at this watch store! The staff was friendly and knowledgeable, and they helped me find the perfect watch. Good selection and fair prices. I’ll definitely come back again!<\/p>","avatar":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/google-icon-logo-symbol-free-png.webp","author":"Delos Reyes, Aramae J.","bio":"","product":""}},"testimonial_n7YTMt":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Testimonials","text":"<p>We were looking for good genuine watches and we found mona watches we were lucky enough to meet them and we got reallly good watches and with reasonable prices the owners are so helpful and patient to listen and cater our needs . Thank you and good luck mona watches <\/p>","avatar":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/google-icon-logo-symbol-free-png.webp","author":"Sherni Slays","bio":"","product":""}},"testimonial_G7VhUG":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Testimonials","text":"<p>They repaired my saphire glass on my rolex, polished it and it look brand new !! They also came to my flat to get it and gave it back in 48hrs right before my business trip. These guys are amazing, ive used them twice now. VERY happy customer<\/p>","avatar":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/google-icon-logo-symbol-free-png.webp","author":"Kim Than","bio":"","product":""}}},"block_order":["testimonial_tCtmmT","testimonial_4nXcQ7","testimonial_dPMfPd","testimonial_CXAGMb","testimonial_V9EYhr","testimonial_9AetwN","testimonial_n7YTMt","testimonial_G7VhUG"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":[],"settings":{"container":"fixed","color_scheme":"scheme-2","section_header_alignment":"center","section_header_alignment_mobile":"center","subheading":"","heading":"WHY WATCH ENTHUSIASTS TRUST US","highlight_style":"none","highlight_font_style":"italic","highlight_style_color":"","highlight_text_color":"","heading_size":"h4","description":"","text_size":"text-base","layout":"focused","card_color_scheme":"scheme-2","card_content_color_scheme":"","card_image_ratio":"adapt","card_heading_size":"h4","card_text_size":"h1","author_info_layout":"vertical","card_trigger_behavior":"click","show_image":true,"show_author_image":true,"colu